---
import EventGroupPage from '../components/EventGroupPage.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<EventGroupPage sectionKey="cursed" title="Cursed Events" active="cursed-events" pageMark="🐈‍⬛">
  Every event the <strong>Cursed</strong> <a href={`${base}traits`}>trait</a> touches. Some need a Cursed
  character, some give the trait, and a few do both. Look for Altruism, Asceticism, Carnivorism and Come
  to Collect, which can <strong>remove</strong> the curse. Cursed and <a href={`${base}blessed-events`}>Blessed</a>
  replace each other. These events also appear in their own category on <a href={`${base}events`}>Story Events</a>.
</EventGroupPage>
